<Base title="Disclaimer" description="Disclaimer of Talha M Blog: our content is for information only, how we handle accuracy, sources and corrections.">
  <section class="article-head"><h1>Disclaimer</h1></section>
  <div class="prose">
    <p><em>Last updated: October 11, 2026</em></p>

    <h2>Information only</h2>
    <p>Everything on Talha M Blog is published for general information and education only. It is not professional advice of any kind (legal, medical, financial or otherwise). For decisions that matter, please consult a qualified professional or an official source.</p>

    <h2>Accuracy and updates</h2>
    <p>We explain news stories in simple words and try to check facts before publishing. Still, events develop quickly and details can change after an article is published. When we learn that something is wrong or outdated, we update the article and show an "Updated" date on it.</p>

    <h2>Sources</h2>
    <p>Where possible, articles name or link their sources so readers can read the original reports themselves.</p>

    <h2>Opinions and views</h2>
    <p>Reporting about a person, party or event does not mean we support or oppose them. Our aim is to explain what happened in a neutral and simple way.</p>

    <h2>External links and products</h2>
    <p>Links to other websites and mentions of products or tools are for information only. We are not responsible for the content, prices or policies of outside websites, and mentioning a product is not a guarantee that it is right for you.</p>

    <h2>Report a mistake</h2>
    <p>If you find a mistake, please tell us through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> and we will check it and fix it if needed.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
